    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An excellent opportunity to acquire a 0.92-hectare (2.27-acre) level, hard-core surfaced commercial site with full planning permission for a 25,000 sq. ft. building.\nIdeally suited for manufacturing, warehousing, trade counter, showroom, or commercial use, with provision for ancillary office accommodation.\nKey features include:\n0.92 hectares (2.27 acres) of level, hard-core surfaced land.\nPlanning permission for a 25,000 sq. ft. commercial building.\nOver 100 metres of excellent visibility and passing traffic exposure along the busy N56, \nStrategic location between Donegal Town (c 5.5km) and Killybegs (c.18km) with excellent access to the wider Donegal road network.\nAll mains services available on site, allowing for efficient development.\nHigh-profile location ideal for businesses seeking a prominent presence on one of Donegal's principal routes.\nOption to purchase an additional adjoining 1.56 hectares (3.85 acres), offering excellent potential for future expansion or a larger-scale development.\nEnquiries welcome."
      },
